      "target": "아이는 돼지저금통에 저축이 늘었다며 좋아해요.",
      "reading": "aineun dwaejijeogeumtong-e jeochugi neureossdamyeo joahaeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The child is happy, saying the savings have grown in the piggy bank.",
